      384.13,
      539.88,
      479.2
    ],
    "text": "BY virtue of the powers vested in me by Section 27(1) of the Universities Act, No. 16 of 1978, I, Kabir Hashim, Ministerof Higher Education and Highways, on the recommendation of the University Grants Commission, do by this Order,amend the Schedule to the Order published in Gazette Extraordinary No. 1454/37 of July 22, 2006 (as last amended byOrder published in Gazette Extraordinary No. 2023/33 of June 14, 2017) which specifies the Faculties and the Departmentof the University of Kelaniya, Sri Lanka, which is deemed by virtue of the provisions of Section 139 of the aforesaid Act,to be a University established under Section 21 of the said Act, by the substitution for the entry \u201cDepartment of Sanskrit\u201dappearing in Column II of the Schedule which corresponds to the item \u201cFaculty of Humanities\u201d appearing in Column I ofthe Schedule of the following entry :-",
